<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Programação - Semana de Tecnologia 2026</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --accent-color: #38bdf8;
            --accent-hover: #0284c7;
            --text-color: #f8fafc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        header {
            background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 1.25rem 2rem;
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.35rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        nav a {
            color: var(--text-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 1rem;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-color);
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 2.5rem auto;
            padding: 0 1.5rem;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .content-card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .schedule-list {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 1.25rem;
        }

        .schedule-item {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.35rem;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-left-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .schedule-item:hover {
            transform: translateX(6px);
            border-left-color: #34d399;
        }

        .item-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 0.5rem;
        }

        .time {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.1);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .tag-category {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .title {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #f1f5f9;
        }

        .speaker {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        .btn-back {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 2rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-back:hover {
            transform: translateX(-4px);
        }

        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="/" class="logo">⚡ SemanaTech 2026</a>
            <nav>
                <a href="/">Início</a>
                <a href="/sobre">Sobre</a>
                <a href="/programacao" style="color: var(--accent-color);">Programação</a>
                <a href="/contato">Contato</a>
                <a href="/admin/inscricao">Inscrição</a>
            </nav>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <article class="content-card">
            <h1>Grade de Programação</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Confira a grade oficial de palestras e workshops práticos confirmados para a semana.</p>

            <ul class="schedule-list">
                <li class="schedule-item">
                    <div class="item-header">
                        <span class="time">⏰ 09:00 - 10:30</span>
                        <span class="tag-category">Palestra Magna</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="title">Inteligência Artificial no Desenvolvimento Moderno de Software</span>
                    <span class="speaker">Palestrante: Dra. Ana Luiza Ribeiro (Pesquisadora em IA)</span>
                </li>

                <li class="schedule-item">
                    <div class="item-header">
                        <span class="time">⏰ 10:45 - 12:00</span>
                        <span class="tag-category">Workshop Prático</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="title">Arquitetura Limpa e Modularização com Node.js e Express</span>
                    <span class="speaker">Instrutor: Carlos Mendonça (Tech Lead na TechCorp)</span>
                </li>

                <li class="schedule-item">
                    <div class="item-header">
                        <span class="time">⏰ 13:30 - 15:00</span>
                        <span class="tag-category">Mesa Redonda</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="title">Carreira em TI: Transição, Desafios do Mercado e Contratação</span>
                    <span class="speaker">Convidados: Especialistas de RH Tech e Desenvolvedores Sêniores</span>
                </li>

                <li class="schedule-item">
                    <div class="item-header">
                        <span class="time">⏰ 15:15 - 16:30</span>
                        <span class="tag-category">Palestra Técnica</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="title">Infraestrutura em Nuvem: Microsserviços com Docker e Kubernetes</span>
                    <span class="speaker">Palestrante: Mariana Ramos (DevOps Engineer)</span>
                </li>

                <li class="schedule-item">
                    <div class="item-header">
                        <span class="time">⏰ 16:45 - 18:00</span>
                        <span class="tag-category">Workshop Prático</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="title">Construindo APIs RESTful Seguras e Escaláveis com Boas Práticas</span>
                    <span class="speaker">Instrutor: Gustavo Henrique (Desenvolvedor Backend Pleno)</span>
                </li>

                <li class="schedule-item">
                    <div class="item-header">
                        <span class="time">⏰ 18:30 - 20:00</span>
                        <span class="tag-category">Painel & Hackathon</span>
                    </div>
                    <span class="title">Lightning Talks de Projetos Universitários e Premiação do Hackathon</span>
                    <span class="speaker">Banca Avaliadora: Professores e Mentores Convidados</span>
                </li>
            </ul>

            <a href="/" class="btn-back">← Voltar para a Página Inicial</a>
        </article>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Semana de Tecnologia. Desenvolvido com Node.js, Express e EJS.</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
